# Build context hygiene: exclude the git internals, the large spring-security submodule, scratch
# output, and the self-hosted `{module}/build/` dirs (Maven `target/` dirs are kept because the
# Dockerfiles COPY the built jars and `dependencies/` folders out of them).
.git
.gitmodules
spring-security/
tmp/
**/build/
# Host Maven cache (large, machine-specific); repository-proxy image builds resolve their own.
.m2/